jobs.description:
Do you want a well-paid side job as a Warehouse Employee near Nijmegen, in the evenings during the week or in the weekend? You start at €15.69 gross per hour, and with the weekend rates you can earn up to €23.50 per hour. As a Warehouse Employee you:  - Take stock of the products in the warehouse;
 - Check and process new and incoming products;
 - Get orders ready for shipment.


What makes this job stand out is the flexibility. Your working days are set in consultation, and there is understanding for things that take up your time, such as an exam week.

From a Warehouse Employee, we expect the following:  - You're available on short notice, preferably right away;
 - You have your own transport to get to Oosterhout (near Nijmegen);
 - A proficiency in English and/or Dutch on B1/B2 level.

 In this role it's important that you're a detail orientated person, accuracy is more important than speed in this position.
